{"ID":"20240513083205-pfzgldj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083205-pfzgldj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083205-pfzgldj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513142908-bciwgxe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513142908-bciwgxe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513142908-bciwgxe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:398,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:398\u0026#125;","title":"172","type":"doc","updated":"20240515122641"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513142908-bciwgxe","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1059px;","id":"20240513142908-bciwgxe","updated":"20240515122641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"152-2 I, A"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"50+ Medium"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008-05-08"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5/6來診大青龍湯證，今日回診仍有痰不多，但喉癢一直咳等症狀。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1、咳"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：平躺無咳"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→代表肺內無積水，坐起來咳，痰不容易咳出，喉癢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少胃口"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、身痛："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、汗："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 有"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"渴有，喜冷飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左手脈弦細，右手脈緩稍大"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→緩代表胃氣回復，稍大代表有點熱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃白厚。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診：診斷：肺中溼熱兼水氣"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：麻杏石甘湯麻黃2錢   杏仁2錢 石膏 5錢 甘草2錢 半夏2錢 南星2錢一帖   6→2 bf BS"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈弦細表示肺有水氣， 喜冷飲脈大表肺有積熱，喉癢是因停留於肺的水氣往上沖而造成喉癢 說明"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(1)麻黃宣肺氣。杏仁防止發表過度而傷到肺陰。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2)石膏名為白虎，是清涼解熱的要藥，能清肺胃三焦氣分之熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(3)甘草保護脾胃津液，及調和諸藥。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(4)半夏清除積於肺的水氣，南星去除肺中的膠痰。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}